Security and no-claim negative proof:

- AI classifier output is parsed as evidence only.
- Missing stored evidence refs are rejected.
- Direct action requests are rejected.
- Forbidden action fields are rejected before policy handoff.
- Duration fields are rejected so AI cannot invent use time.
- Raw scan fields are rejected so AI cannot claim direct OS/process scanning.
- Content claim flags must be false.
- Existing activity-domain digest proof remains the source spine, but this slice
  does not claim model quality, provider execution, policy execution, portal
  rendering, or adapter enforcement.
